      "lines": [
        "г) $\\frac{b}{4}-5a$，已知 $1.2<a<1.3$，$2<b<3$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "654",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "估计下列各式的值所在的范围：",
        "а) $mn-1$，已知 $2\\le m\\le3$，$11\\le n\\le12$；",
        "б) $m(n-1)$，已知 $0.1\\le m\\le0.2$，$5.1\\le n\\le5.2$；",
        "в) $\\frac{1}{m}+n$，已知 $5\\le m\\le10$，$12\\le n\\le15$；",
        "г) $\\frac{1}{m+n}$，已知 $7\\le m\\le8$，$13\\le n\\le14$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "655",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "已知 $3\\le a\\le10$，$1\\le x\\le4$，分别求差 $ax-2x$",
        "与积 $x(a-2)$ 的值的界，并对所得结果进行比较."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "656",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $3\\le x\\le4$，$1\\le y\\le2$. 分别确定积 $(x+y)(x-y)$",
        "与差 $x^2-y^2$ 的值的界. 并对所得结果进行比较."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "657",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "设 $A$、$B$、$C$ 是不在同一条直线上的三点，并且已知",
        "$29\\mathrm{mm}<|AB|<31\\mathrm{mm}$，$39\\mathrm{mm}<|BC|<41\\mathrm{mm}$. 距离 $AC$",
        "能不能等于：",
        "а) $30\\mathrm{mm}$；　б) $60\\mathrm{mm}$？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "658",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": true,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "求下列各式的值的界：",
        "а) $m+n-k$，如果 $3.7<m<3.8$，$2.6<n<2.7$，",
        "$1.2<k<1.3$；",
        "б) $\\frac{a}{c}+b$，如果 $3.25<a<3.26$，$6.13<b<6.14$，",
        "$2.51<c<2.52$；",
        "в) $\\frac{a}{b-c}$，如果 $3.04<a<3.05$，$1.15<b<1.16$，",
        "$0.14<c<0.15$."
      ]
    },
